  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The proposed vehicle crossover, by reason of its location and pathway, would result in a crossover that provides poor vehicular access due to proposed vehicle pathway intersecting the boundary of the neighbouring property and furthermore&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;traverses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;the vehice pathway to the neighbouring property at no.50 Village Way. As such, the design and layout of the access/vehicle crossover is not considered to be safe, secure and fit for purpose. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policy DM42 of Harrow&#x27;s Development Management Policies Local Plan 2013 and therefore considered to be unacceptable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
